OL,3,ATrump and Xi exchange warm words at
OL,4,Astate dinner but little progress on key
OL,5,Aissues
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump and China's
OL,8,FPresident Xi Jinping exchanged warm
OL,9,Fwords at a lavish White House state
OL,10,Fdinner but gave little indication of
OL,11,Fprogress on pressing issues.
OL,13,FXi stressed that they should ensure AI
OL,14,Fremain "under human control" and act
OL,15,F"as responsible major countries", while
OL,16,FTrump toasted a future of "harmony,
OL,17,Fpeace and success" for both nations.
